  ServingSeatPermit, ServingSeatPermitClaims, FrontDoorIdentity, FrontDoorVerdict, FrontDoorForward, FrontDoorRefused,
  FrontDoorRefusal, DoorCallerUnauthenticated, DoorPermitAbsent, DoorPermitMacRefused, DoorPermitForAnotherGroup,
