  FrontDoorRedemption, DoorRedeemed, DoorRedemptionRefused,
  DoorPoolConfiguredForAnotherGroup, DoorPoolConfiguredTwice, DoorPoolSelected, front_door_pool_for,
  PlanLeaveWithHolder, PlanRelease, front_door_recovery_plan,
